<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Go Fundamentals &amp; Idioms on Quy Duong Minh — Software Engineer</title><link>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/fundamentals/</link><description>Recent content in Go Fundamentals &amp; Idioms on Quy Duong Minh — Software Engineer</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>vi-VN</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/fundamentals/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>01. Interfaces &amp; implicit satisfaction</title><link>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/fundamentals/01-interfaces-implicit-satisfaction/</link><pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/fundamentals/01-interfaces-implicit-satisfaction/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Mở đầu mini-series Fundamentals &amp;amp; Idioms: interface trong Go là điểm khác biệt lớn nhất so với các ngôn ngữ OOP truyền thống (Java, C#) — không có từ khoá &lt;code&gt;implements&lt;/code&gt;, và chính sự &amp;ldquo;ngầm định&amp;rdquo; này là nguồn gốc của bug nổi tiếng nhất trong Go: nil interface trap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="interface-satisfaction-ngầm-định"&gt;Interface satisfaction ngầm định&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Không cần khai báo &lt;code&gt;implements&lt;/code&gt; — 1 type tự động thoả mãn interface nếu có đủ method đúng signature. Hệ quả trực tiếp: có thể định nghĩa interface ở phía &lt;em&gt;consumer&lt;/em&gt; (nơi dùng), không cần biết trước ở phía &lt;em&gt;implementer&lt;/em&gt; — khác hẳn Java/C#, nơi type phải khai báo tường minh nó implement interface nào.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>02. Error handling idioms</title><link>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/fundamentals/02-error-handling-idioms/</link><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/fundamentals/02-error-handling-idioms/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="../01-interfaces-implicit-satisfaction/"&gt;Bài 01&lt;/a&gt; kết thúc với &lt;code&gt;error&lt;/code&gt; là 1 interface (&lt;code&gt;type error interface { Error() string }&lt;/code&gt;). Bài này đi vào idiom xử lý lỗi của Go — cố tình không có exception, và vì sao đó là quyết định thiết kế có chủ đích, không phải thiếu sót.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="sentinel-error--so-sánh-trực-tiếp"&gt;Sentinel error — so sánh trực tiếp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" data-copy-code data-copied-label="Copied"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;var&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;ErrNotFound&lt;/span&gt; = &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;errors&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;New&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;not found&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;find&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;) &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;error&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;!=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;ErrNotFound&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;nil&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" data-copy-code data-copied-label="Copied"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;find&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;42&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Println&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;So sánh trực tiếp ==:&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;==&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;ErrNotFound&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Println&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;errors.Is:&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;errors&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Is&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;err&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;ErrNotFound&lt;/span&gt;))&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" data-copy-code data-copied-label="Copied"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;So sánh trực tiếp ==: true
errors.Is: true&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sentinel error là 1 giá trị &lt;code&gt;error&lt;/code&gt; cố định, so sánh được bằng &lt;code&gt;==&lt;/code&gt; (hoặc &lt;code&gt;errors.Is&lt;/code&gt;, làm việc tương tự với sentinel error đơn giản). &lt;strong&gt;Giới hạn&lt;/strong&gt;: không mang được thông tin ngữ cảnh — biết &amp;ldquo;not found&amp;rdquo; nhưng không biết đang tìm ID nào, resource gì.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>03. Value vs Pointer receiver &amp; struct embedding</title><link>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/fundamentals/03-value-pointer-receiver-embedding/</link><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/fundamentals/03-value-pointer-receiver-embedding/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Go truyền mọi thứ theo giá trị (pass by value) — kể cả struct. Bài này đi vào hệ quả trực tiếp: khi nào 1 struct bị copy mà lập trình viên không nhận ra, và vì sao chọn sai giữa value/pointer receiver là nguồn bug âm thầm phổ biến.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="value-receiver-method-nhận-bản-copy"&gt;Value receiver: method nhận bản copy&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" data-copy-code data-copied-label="Copied"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;type&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;CounterWrong&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;struct&lt;/span&gt;{ &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;n&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;c&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;CounterWrong&lt;/span&gt;) &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Inc&lt;/span&gt;() { &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;++&lt;/span&gt; } &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// value receiver: sửa bản copy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" data-copy-code data-copied-label="Copied"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;wrong&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;CounterWrong&lt;/span&gt;{}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;i&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;i&lt;/span&gt; &amp;lt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;++&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;wrong&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Inc&lt;/span&gt;()
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Println&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;wrong.n =&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;wrong&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" data-copy-code data-copied-label="Copied"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;wrong.n = 0&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;0&lt;/code&gt;, không phải &lt;code&gt;5&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; — mỗi lần gọi &lt;code&gt;wrong.Inc()&lt;/code&gt;, Go tạo 1 bản copy của &lt;code&gt;CounterWrong&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;c.n++&lt;/code&gt; chỉ tăng trên bản copy đó, rồi bản copy bị vứt bỏ ngay khi hàm kết thúc. Struct gốc &lt;code&gt;wrong&lt;/code&gt; chưa từng bị đổi.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>04. Generics: type parameter &amp; constraints</title><link>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/fundamentals/04-generics-type-parameters/</link><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/fundamentals/04-generics-type-parameters/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Generics vào Go từ bản 1.18 (2022) — muộn hơn hẳn đa số ngôn ngữ mainstream, có chủ đích. Bài này không chỉ dạy cú pháp, mà tập trung vào ranh giới thực dụng: khi nào generics thực sự đáng dùng, khi nào interface truyền thống vẫn tốt hơn — kể cả linh hoạt hơn.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="type-parameter--cú-pháp-cơ-bản"&gt;Type parameter — cú pháp cơ bản&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" data-copy-code data-copied-label="Copied"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Map&lt;/span&gt;[&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;T&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;U&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;any&lt;/span&gt;](&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;s&lt;/span&gt; []&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;T&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;f&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;T&lt;/span&gt;) &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;U&lt;/span&gt;) []&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;U&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;result&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; make([]&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;U&lt;/span&gt;, len(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;))
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;v&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;range&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;s&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;result&lt;/span&gt;[&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;] = &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;v&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;result&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" data-copy-code data-copied-label="Copied"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;nums&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; []&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;{&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;doubled&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Map&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;nums&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;n&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;) &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; { &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;n&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; })
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;strs&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Map&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;nums&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;n&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;) &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt; { &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Sprintf&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;n=%d&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;) })&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" data-copy-code data-copied-label="Copied"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;doubled: [2 4 6 8]
strs: [n=1 n=2 n=3 n=4]&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;Map&lt;/code&gt; hoạt động với &lt;strong&gt;bất kỳ cặp kiểu &lt;code&gt;T&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;U&lt;/code&gt; nào&lt;/strong&gt;, và Go tự suy luận kiểu (&lt;code&gt;T=int, U=int&lt;/code&gt; ở lần gọi đầu; &lt;code&gt;T=int, U=string&lt;/code&gt; ở lần gọi sau) — không cần khai báo tường minh &lt;code&gt;Map[int, int](...)&lt;/code&gt;. So với cách làm trước 1.18 (dùng &lt;code&gt;interface{}&lt;/code&gt; + type assertion): mất type safety, lỗi sai kiểu chỉ phát hiện được lúc &lt;strong&gt;chạy&lt;/strong&gt; thay vì lúc &lt;strong&gt;biên dịch&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>05. Slice &amp; Array nội bộ</title><link>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/fundamentals/05-slice-array-noi-bo/</link><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/fundamentals/05-slice-array-noi-bo/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Slice là cấu trúc dữ liệu dùng nhiều nhất trong Go, và cũng là nguồn bug âm thầm phổ biến nhất — vì slice không phải mảng, nó là 1 &amp;ldquo;view&amp;rdquo; (con trỏ + length + capacity) trỏ vào 1 underlying array có thể &lt;strong&gt;bị chia sẻ&lt;/strong&gt; giữa nhiều slice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="slice-là-gì-bên-dưới-pointer--len--cap"&gt;Slice là gì bên dưới: pointer + len + cap&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" data-copy-code data-copied-label="Copied"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; []&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;{&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;}
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;b&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;[&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;:&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;] &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// slicing tạo view, không copy dữ liệu&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Printf&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;a: %v, len=%d, cap=%d\n&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;, len(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;), cap(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;))
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Printf&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;b: %v, len=%d, cap=%d\n&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;, len(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;), cap(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;))
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Println&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Địa chỉ b[0] có trùng địa chỉ a[1]?&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;b&lt;/span&gt;[&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;] &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;==&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;[&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;])&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" data-copy-code data-copied-label="Copied"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;a: [1 2 3 4 5], len=5, cap=5
b: [2 3], len=2, cap=4
Địa chỉ b[0] có trùng địa chỉ a[1]? true&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;true&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; — &lt;code&gt;b[0]&lt;/code&gt; và &lt;code&gt;a[1]&lt;/code&gt; là &lt;strong&gt;cùng 1 ô nhớ&lt;/strong&gt;. Chú ý cả &lt;code&gt;cap(b) = 4&lt;/code&gt;, không phải &lt;code&gt;2&lt;/code&gt; (bằng &lt;code&gt;len(b)&lt;/code&gt;): slicing giữ nguyên phần capacity còn lại của underlying array tính từ điểm bắt đầu, không cắt gọn theo &lt;code&gt;len&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>06. Map nội bộ &amp; zero value</title><link>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/fundamentals/06-map-noi-bo-zero-value/</link><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/fundamentals/06-map-noi-bo-zero-value/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Bài cuối mini-series Fundamentals &amp;amp; Idioms: map là cấu trúc dữ liệu còn lại hay bị hiểu sai — đặc biệt điểm khác biệt quan trọng nhất so với slice (&lt;a href="../05-slice-array-noi-bo/"&gt;bài 05&lt;/a&gt;): map &lt;strong&gt;không an toàn&lt;/strong&gt; khi ghi đồng thời, và Go cố tình làm nó &lt;strong&gt;crash ngay lập tức&lt;/strong&gt; thay vì âm thầm cho dữ liệu sai.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="zero-value-của-map-nil-không-phải-map-rỗng"&gt;Zero value của map: &lt;code&gt;nil&lt;/code&gt;, không phải map rỗng&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" data-copy-code data-copied-label="Copied"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;var&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;m&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;map&lt;/span&gt;[&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;]&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;int&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// nil map, không phải map rỗng&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Println&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;m == nil?&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;m&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;==&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;nil&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Println&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Đọc từ nil map, key không tồn tại:&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;m&lt;/span&gt;[&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;x&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;])
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;m&lt;/span&gt;[&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;x&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;] = &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;// ghi vào nil map&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chạy thật:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>